<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Philip Morris cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Philip Morris cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers cut its rating of Philip Morris to hold from buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
